    "long_instructions": "## Summarize Information\r\n\r\nThis chatbot will find the three most important details from information you give it.\r\n\r\n1. Choose one the purposes for using AI that you identified.\r\n\r\n2. Test this chatbot to see how well it helps with that purpose.\r\n\r\n   - Find information about your theme from another website. Copy and paste it into the chatbot.\r\n     \r\n     OR\r\n   \r\n   - Click the **microphone button** and talk about something related to your theme.\r\n\r\n3. Judge what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n",
